graph TD
    Start([Inicio de ejecución del Bot]) --> LoadGS[Leer GameState]
    LoadGS --> StateCheck{GameState}

    StateCheck -- NotStarted --> NotStarted[NotStarted]
    StateCheck -- InProgress --> InProgress[InProgress]

    NotStarted --> ChooseStory[Seleccionar historia]
    ChooseStory --> SendIntro[Enviar intro canal general]
    SendIntro --> SetInProg[GameState = InProgress]
    SetInProg --> EndMorning[Fin ejecución lunes AM]

    InProgress --> CheckDailyStart

    subgraph CheckDaily ["CheckDaily (por usuario)"]
        CheckDailyStart --> CheckHours[Analizar horas de hoy]
        CheckHours --> UserStatus{Cumplió meta?}
        UserStatus -- No --> SendDM[Enviar DM advertencia]
        UserStatus -- Sí --> NoAction[Sin acción]
    end

    NoAction --> AnteultimoCheck
    SendDM --> AnteultimoCheck

    AnteultimoCheck{Anteúltimo día y meta < 60%?}
    AnteultimoCheck -- Sí --> SendWarning[Advertencia canal general]
    AnteultimoCheck -- No --> ContinueAfterAnteultimo[Continuar]

    SendWarning --> ContinueAfterAnteultimo
    ContinueAfterAnteultimo --> EndWeekCheck{Último día?}

    EndWeekCheck -- No --> SaveState[Guardar GameState]
    EndWeekCheck -- Sí --> EndWeek[Fin de semana]

    EndWeek --> VictoryCheck{Meta semanal cumplida?}
    VictoryCheck -- Sí --> Win[Victoria]
    VictoryCheck -- No --> Loss[Derrota]

    Win --> ResetState[GameState = NotStarted]
    Loss --> ResetState
    ResetState --> SaveState
    SaveState --> End([Fin ejecución Bot])
